    <item>
      <title>Guardians of the Kingdom</title>
      <author>Kentoame</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/716804</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/716804#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">42bf590386d40d8f71fda383861734c418cd2faf</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:30:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad16d9b38457.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79b3b13.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a287bc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e76ba35e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78e2497.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e781dfb4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79e487b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a6192d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77708e0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaf1834cbb43.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77d3ed0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e76dd24c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e790f2b8.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7702c2a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77dca3a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e77e9d70.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78240c4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79df825.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e78dadf0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e796c7a4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a26696.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94ec7cdeb0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e79bb041.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94e7a281f5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e5589216.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e59d0be9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e62414e4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e6f7b164.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e718c89c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e7302ea3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e7546f81.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69e757b359.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab6a10d2df03.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9ab14d442b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9b111508d7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9b111c90a1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1f239ca.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1f6299b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1f81792.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1f89c07.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1fa7c46.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1fc10bd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6abb5d1ff3c14.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; ver. 1.0.1 Update&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Ancient orange glow for all Guardian Stalkers and Decayed Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Amiibo can now summon Guardian Turrets and Skywatchers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Support&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you like my mods and want to buy me a coffee:&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://xn--kofi-m86a.com/kento1911" target="_blank"&gt;https://ko‑fi.com/kento1911&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Support is completely optional, all mods remain &lt;b&gt;100% free&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introduction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;I've long wanted a mod that lets Guardians aid Link in combat, yet I struggled for years to make it functional. I experimented countless times without success. Over the past two years, while researching *Tears of the Kingdom* mechanics, I revisited *Breath of the Wild* and kept testing, but still found no working solution. Then in mid‑2026, I tested a set of parameters by chance — and it worked. My dream was finally realized, and the solution turned out to be surprisingly simple.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Version Support&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715476"&gt;Wii U: ver. 1.5.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/716804"&gt;Switch: ver. 1.6.0, 1.9.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Core Feature&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1.Guardians ignore Link and actively hunt all enemies across Hyrule.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache42.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b60e0713.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache38.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b602d097.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache40.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcb0d457.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.All Guardian Stalkers and Decayed Guardians feature ancient orange emission glow. Skywatchers and Turrets already have native ancient orange variants within the base game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace467c21c81.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace4619dd238.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache41.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace371c54a45.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Affected Units&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache45.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b6079350.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod affects only Guardian Stalkers, Skywatchers, Turrets, and Decayed Guardians. Guardian Scouts can be targeted by these Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Amiibo Spawning&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Several Amiibo with few unique special drops have been repurposed as Guardian spawners.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1.Guardian Amiibo: Spawns Guardian Stalkers&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace400b698af.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.Archer Link Amiibo: Spawns uncorrupted Guardian Turrets (spawn orientation randomized, Turrets ignore gravity and retain their spawn rotation, while Stalkers and Skywatchers are affected by gravity and auto-align upright).&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace3bb6ae616.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;3.Bokoblin Amiibo: Spawns uncorrupted Skywatchers&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache52.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace3bb6c83be.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0193c5a.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;One spawn per scan under normal conditions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache54.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab6a0d62212a.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since Amiibo cannot be used in many in‑game situations, spawning via a save editor or other mod spawn tools is recommended.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Tip&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1.Whistling draws Guardian attention toward Link's position, which can be used to lure them onto nearby enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0eeb2e9.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.Guardians are high‑poly entities. Spawning too many may cause frame‑rate drops.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace377f5d318.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Combat Rules&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Guardian attacks can still damage Link, and Guardians can also damage one another.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache42.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aba954db0c21.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache20.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aba954d62c5d.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. If Link accidentally damages a Guardian, it will retaliate once, then drop aggro.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache35.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9b0e21c7f8.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Dormant Guardians fire a single shot upon detecting Link.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache47.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9b0e3321b1.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Urbosa's Fury still works against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ace3afc828e0.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Enemy Behavior toward Guardians&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Main‑story bosses, Yiga Clan members, Hinoxes, and Molduga target only Link and will not engage Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache20.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcb91a14.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache46.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcae870c.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache41.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bca7987e.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache41.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5fcebd1.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache31.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff2d5e4.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache39.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f24f7e.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache41.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f03389.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache31.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff1368a.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache38.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f7db71.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache36.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcbce22f.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Regular enemies (Bokoblins, Moblins, Lizalfos, Lynels, Chuchus, Octoroks, Wizzrobes, Pebblits, Keeses) will attack Guardians, but their attacks register no collision or damage against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d08bbf2e.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache53.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5feb152.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache42.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff290bd.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Taluses can fight Guardians with fully functional damage exchange.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache42.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5fda1be.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache52.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94be8d3d34.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache47.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaf1817553db.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Wolf Link has infinite HP, ignores Guardians, and is ignored by them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache38.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0f7b366.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab9aaeaf191f.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Optional Install Toggles&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. **Guardian Civil War**&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache37.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d113013b.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache36.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b603a5f0.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache54.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94dca8a9bc.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache52.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b601a569.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache52.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d1386e77.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache41.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69ce672252.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache40.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d04b2eab.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache52.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69cf50a3dc.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache35.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69ce782473.jpg"&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache37.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69cf31ed0a.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Guardian Stalkers, Turrets, Skywatchers, and Decayed Guardians attack each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. **Regular Enemies Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache53.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d1617989.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache36.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b60e5824.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache40.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aba93f524ea7.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://filecache38.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aba93f50cec2.jpg"&gt;&lt;br&gt;The listed regular enemies will not target Link; Guardians will still seek out and fight these enemies.&lt;br&gt;*Sandbox observation feature — not for standard gameplay.*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. **Guardian Civil War + Regular Enemies Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enables both features above.</description>
